[
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrderIso#doc\">docs#OrderIso</a> is an abbrev for <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=RelIso#doc\">docs#RelIso</a>, but we have <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=OrderIso.instEquivLike#doc\">docs#OrderIso.instEquivLike</a> in addition to <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=RelIso.instEquivLike#doc\">docs#RelIso.instEquivLike</a>. Deleting the extra instance makes <code>to_dual</code> fail:</p>",
        "id": 591014670,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1777247534
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">LE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">LE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"n\">o</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- casting an `OrderIso` to an `Equiv` using its `EquivLike` instance:</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">to_dual</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- let's use `RelIso.instEquivLike` instead: (`OrderIso` is an abbrev for `RelIso`)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">attribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">OrderIso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instEquivLike</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- error: @[to_dual] failed to insert a cast -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">substring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">to_dual</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sup'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- the instances are defeq:</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">OrderIso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instEquivLike</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RelIso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instEquivLike</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- but not very defeq:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- error -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">substring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">OrderIso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instEquivLike</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RelIso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instEquivLike</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">with_reducible_and_instances</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- may the best instance win:</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myInstance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">EquivLike</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"n\">o</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inferInstance</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">to_dual</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sup''</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myInstance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">β</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">RelIso</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instEquivLike</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">with_reducible_and_instances</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 591014679,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1777247543
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><code>OrderIso</code> does have a <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/blob/1727d0105601ed069b941f7d5127d7fdd72a3ac2/Mathlib/Order/Hom/Basic.lean#L108-L110\"><code>to_dual_insert_cast_fun</code></a> btw, but I'm not sure how <code>to_dual</code>s cast mechanism works to say what's the issue.</p>",
        "id": 591014738,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1777247595
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>probably <code>OrderIso.instEquivLike</code> is the one that needs to be changed</p>",
        "id": 591014765,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1777247644
    },
    {
